#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:119
msgid "Enable t&int"
msgstr "Aktiveer tint"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:121
msgid "Enables tinting the background that shows through in transparent mode."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer verdonkering van die agtergrond wat vertoon deur in transparent "
"modus."

